# Design system

## Tokens

- Source of truth: brand CSS variables in `src/app/globals.css` (`--navy`, `--coral`, `--turquoise`, `--sand`, …).
- shadcn semantic tokens (`--background`, `--primary`, `--ring`, …) alias those brand values.
- Do not introduce a second palette or default purple/neutral shadcn theme.

## Components

- `src/components/ui` — foundational primitives only (no domain data).
- `src/components/shared` — cross-domain compositions and universal states.
- Add new shadcn primitives only when ≥2 real use cases exist.
- Mobile-first; target WCAG 2.2 AA; handle loading, empty, error, disabled, focus, validation, responsive states.
- Prefer Storybook stories for `ui` + `shared` when documenting visuals.
